 back their word, the 'Trilby Ashers' are the real reason why the Duke of Caster's words hold any weight.","abilities":["After several attacks, moves towards the next checkpoint for the next attack"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":36000,"atk":2250,"def":500,"res":35,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":6}},"norport_spy":{"slug":"norport_spy","name":"Norport Spy","icon":"/enemies-icons/Norport Spy.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Military spies disguised as civilians in Norport Borough, lacking the communication channels to pass on their abundant intel. They were already helping their Dukes learn about their rivals before the borough broke off from Londinium, and have seamlessly transitioned to spying on the Sarkaz Army's movements after the Military Commission seized control.","abilities":["Friendly Unit","Once their identity is confirmed, restores your max DP after retreating to the Objective Point"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":250,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"damazti_cluster_enemy_1542_wdslm":{"slug":"damazti_cluster_enemy_1542_wdslm","name":"'Damazti Cluster'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Damazti Cluster'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A long-lived that has drifted away from the Sarkaz Royal Court. They have taken the rise and fall of the various races as a sort of life experience, but the Damazti Cluster has yet to find the answer to what 'living' means.","abilities":["Spy","Whenever a certain percentage of HP is lost, summons an Isomorphic Fragment on an Operator or on the field that shares HP with self;","Both the Damazti Cluster and Isomorphic Fragments take reduc